# The first meal, the Prologue's Scene 5 (#186): the end of the first quest.
# Played by the SupperTable in the galley (#207) when you've set the spicy
# tomato soup on the long table and rung the bell for supper while he's low.
# Your side is the replies you pick.
#
# He comes over to the table, asks what it is, takes it in (clearing his low
# flag, which empties the bowl), lights up, rises and circles you. The
# captain, called down from the helm, looks in from the hatch stairs, then
# goes back up to the wheel, where the deck talk finds him (#187).

~ start
@send heron captain_supper_seat
@place player supper_seat
@place lantern lantern_arrives
@shot supper_wide cut
@look lantern surprised
lantern: Oh! What's that?
@wait 0.6
lantern: Is that... for me?
- (Nod) -> you_made_it

~ you_made_it
lantern: You made that?
- (Nod again) -> never_had

~ never_had
@look lantern tired
lantern: Well, I...
@wait 1.0
lantern: I've never had soup before.
@shot lantern_table
@go lantern supper_bowl
@wait 1.8
@look lantern mended
clear lantern_low
set warmed_lantern
@wait 0.6
@look lantern pleased
lantern: Oh!
@shot supper_wide
@go lantern lantern_rises
@wait 1.0
lantern: Oh, that's much better!
@go lantern lantern_circle_1
@wait 0.6
@go lantern lantern_circle_2
@wait 0.6
@go lantern lantern_circle_3
@wait 0.6
@go lantern lantern_circle_4
@wait 0.6
@go lantern lantern_thanks
lantern: I feel wonderful!
@walk heron captain_supper_seat
@face heron lantern
@wait 0.6
heron: Well, I'll be.
@shot supper_wide
lantern: Look! Look at me!
heron: I can see.
lantern: They made me soup!
heron: Yes. I gathered that.
@face heron player
@send heron wheel
@wait 0.8
lantern: Thank you.
@wait 1.0
lantern: I remember you reaching for me.
lantern: I'm glad you did.
@home lantern
@shot free
-> END
